  "title": "Cifral — Scope-of-Supply catalog",
  "description": "The canonical, versioned list of scope-of-supply items a proposal can contain. Scope is decided PER REQUEST (not per client): the same reseller may send a full-scope modernization RFQ today and a materials-and-engineering-only RFQ tomorrow. Module 1 extracts a `scope_of_supply` map (item key -> boolean) against these keys; that one map then drives pricing lines (Module 3), narrative sections (Module 2), and template blocks (Module 4). To add or rename a scope item, edit THIS file, then update the LLM extraction hints in Module 1, the section prompts in Module 2, and the template block markers documented in docs/TEMPLATE-GUIDE.md.",
  "version": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "key": "materials",
      "label_en": "Materials & Equipment Supply",
      "label_es": "Suministro de materiales y equipos",
      "cost_category": "materials",
      "narrative_section": "alcance_tecnico",
      "template_block": "MATERIALS",
      "default_included": true,
      "description": "Physical goods / equipment supplied. Priced via materials_cost (not an hourly category)."
    },
    {
